{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 85,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        179.01329040527344,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "User perspective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        527.0264892578125,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "The GDG assessed whether concurrent testing of multiple samples would increase the diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.06519317626953,
        526.9677734375,
        124.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "yield (i.e. the benefit to patients or the programme in terms of finding more people with TB).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        126.56519317626953,
        526.964599609375,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "One of the PICO questions focused on concurrent use of LC-aNAATs on respiratory and stool",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.065185546875,
        457.98291015625,
        155.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "samples and LF-LAM on urine for the diagnosis of TB in children living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.57679748535156,
        253.505859375,
        183.95680236816406
      ],
      "text": "User preferences and values",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        192.70782470703125,
        526.9700927734375,
        205.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "The interview study and quality evidence synthesis produced no data on the use of LF-LAM in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.70782470703125,
        526.9700927734375,
        219.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "children living with HIV. However, in general, as important outcomes of the diagnostic test,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.70782470703125,
        273.3401794433594,
        233.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "patients in high TB burden settings value:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        240.459716796875,
        78.81909942626953,
        253.60472106933594
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        240.459716796875,
        527.1293334960938,
        253.60472106933594
      ],
      "text": "getting an accurate diagnosis and reaching diagnostic closure (finally knowing “what is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        255.959716796875,
        171.5755157470703,
        269.104736328125
      ],
      "text": "wrong with me”);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.459716796875,
        78.81909942626953,
        284.604736328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        271.459716796875,
        526.963134765625,
        284.604736328125
      ],
      "text": "avoiding diagnostic delays, as they exacerbate existing financial hardships and emotional",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        286.959716796875,
        524.4430541992188,
        300.104736328125
      ],
      "text": "and physical suffering and make people feel guilty for infecting others (especially children);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997349739074707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.459716796875,
        78.81909942626953,
        315.604736328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        302.459716796875,
        236.37738037109375,
        315.604736328125
      ],
      "text": "having accessible facilities; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.959716796875,
        78.81909942626953,
        331.104736328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        317.959716796875,
        391.6973876953125,
        331.104736328125
      ],
      "text": "reducing diagnosis-associated costs (e.g. travel, missing work).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.7983093261719,
        526.6680297851562,
        357.9433288574219
      ],
      "text": "Participants appreciate that stool sample collection is far less invasive than gastric aspirate (see",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986291885375977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.2983093261719,
        163.98040771484375,
        373.4433288574219
      ],
      "text": "). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.809814453125,
        112.7667007446289,
        402.1897888183594
      ],
      "text": "Equity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.4407958984375,
        527.1131591796875,
        425.5858154296875
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent sample testing was not practiced in the study countries. However, concurrent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.9407958984375,
        526.9371337890625,
        441.0858154296875
      ],
      "text": "sample testing could improve access to care by minimizing repeat visits and loss to follow-up",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.4407958984375,
        186.34300231933594,
        456.5858154296875
      ],
      "text": "(see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.4447021484375,
        527.0660400390625,
        480.5897216796875
      ],
      "text": "Using non-sputum samples can improve access to care, especially with a test that can be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.9447021484375,
        526.9810180664062,
        496.0897216796875
      ],
      "text": "performed at all levels of the health carecare system. Challenges with producing sputum of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        498.4447021484375,
        527.1978149414062,
        511.5897216796875
      ],
      "text": "sufficient quality and quantity are well documented and can lead to repeat testing or false",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.9447021484375,
        527.240478515625,
        527.0897216796875
      ],
      "text": "results. Participants highlighted the impact that using stool has on increasing case-finding and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989645004272461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        529.4447021484375,
        440.6361083984375,
        542.5897216796875
      ],
      "text": "access to care, particularly among destitute families (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.956298828125,
        156.2059326171875,
        571.3363037109375
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.5872802734375,
        494.2711181640625,
        594.7322998046875
      ],
      "text": "The interview study produced no data on the use of LF-LAM in children living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.5911865234375,
        527.1918334960938,
        618.7362060546875
      ],
      "text": "Most participants (including parents and legal representatives of children) did not immediately",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974520683288574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.0911865234375,
        526.9458618164062,
        634.2362060546875
      ],
      "text": "understand why multiple samples would be tested concurrently at the same visit, if a respiratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.953049659729004,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.5911865234375,
        526.926025390625,
        649.7362060546875
      ],
      "text": "sample is available. They highlighted that a sputum sample is the preferred choice, and they",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.0911865234375,
        527.2219848632812,
        665.2362060546875
      ],
      "text": "would only collect the second-best sample if that were not available. However, participants also",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.958722114562988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.5911865234375,
        526.7232666015625,
        680.7362060546875
      ],
      "text": "thought that concurrent sample testing could be possible if there was a WHO recommendation,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946972846984863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.0911865234375,
        526.9654541015625,
        696.2362060546875
      ],
      "text": "altered diagnostic algorithms and specific training and capacity strengthening to facilitate it",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.5911865234375,
        186.34300231933594,
        711.7362060546875
      ],
      "text": "(see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        722.5950927734375,
        526.8729858398438,
        735.7401123046875
      ],
      "text": "For young children, stool seems to be an acceptable specimen, especially after adequate training",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        738.0950927734375,
        526.96240234375,
        751.2401123046875
      ],
      "text": "in how to process it. Stool from adults is considered more difficult in terms of both acceptance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.5950927734375,
        527.0382690429688,
        766.7401123046875
      ],
      "text": "and processing time. There was general confidence among participants regarding results from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983488082885742,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        769.0950927734375,
        316.8224792480469,
        782.2401123046875
      ],
      "text": "stool tested by GeneXpert (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 69",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}